{"id":17949,"name":"DeKalb County","slug":"dekalb-county","state":"Alabama","code":"AL","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-lien/tax-lien-states/alabama-tax-lien-sales-how-to-get-12-interest/dekalb-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-13T12:29:22","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Lien Certificates","typicalSaleDate":"April","bidProcedure":"Bid down interest rate","redemptionPeriod":"Generally 3 years","interestRate":"Starts at 12%","extra":[{"label":"Sale Contact","value":"DeKalb County Revenue Commissioner"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"GovEase"},{"label":"County Website","value":"DeKalb County"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"xVMrA7nXNc06RiOYD\"><iframe title=\"Guide to Gaining 12% Yearly - DeKalb County - Alabama Tax Lien Investing\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/fO7HaNOXzxQ?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-guide-to-gaining-12-yearly-dekalb-county-alabama-tax-lien-investing\">Guide to Gaining 12% Yearly &#8211; DeKalb County, Alabama Tax Lien Investing</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Welcome to an exciting opportunity for investors looking to earn up to 12% interest through Tax Lien Sales in DeKalb County, Alabama. This online investment method lets you earn from overdue property taxes without buying property outright. Starting early March, you can register at <a href=\"http://www.govease.com/\">GovEase</a> and join the process from anywhere.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Understanding Tax Lien Certificates</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Tax lien certificates allow investors to pay off delinquent property taxes and earn interest when the property owner repays the debt. In DeKalb County, these certificates start at an interest rate of 12%, which reduces as bidders compete. If the property owner doesn’t pay within the redemption period (usually three years), the investor may foreclose on the property.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Steps to Start Tax Lien Investing in DeKalb County</h3>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Research Local Laws</strong><br><br>Understand the legal framework for tax lien sales in Alabama.<br><br>Key regulations can be found on the<a href=\"https://revenue-dekalbco-al.us/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Revenue Commissioner&#8217;s website</mark></a>.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Visit the Local Treasurer&#8217;s Website</strong><br><br>For tax lien sale information, visit the <a href=\"https://revenue-dekalbco-al.us/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">DeKalb County Revenue</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Commissioner’s page</mark></a>.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Check the Auction Site</strong><br><br>Register and participate in auctions at <a href=\"http://www.govease.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">GovEase</mark></a>.<br><br>The next sale is scheduled for April, from 10:00 AM to 4:00 PM.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Read the Details</strong><br><br>Understand the sale schedule, parcel details, and other essential information on the <a href=\"https://services.revenue-dekalbco-al.us/Property/Property/DelinquentParcels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">DeKalb County Delinquent Tax Sale page</mark></a><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">.</mark></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Contact the County Office</strong><br><br>For additional inquiries, reach out to the DeKalb County Revenue Commissioner’s office.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Important Details</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/DeKalb-County-Courthouse.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/DeKalb-County-Courthouse-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/DeKalb-County-Courthouse-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/DeKalb-County-Courthouse-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/DeKalb-County-Courthouse-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/DeKalb-County-Courthouse-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/DeKalb-County-Courthouse.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/